  "body": "Title & CCC Issued, Act Fast!\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendor – Priced to Sell!\r\n\r\n23A - $1,739,000\r\nApprox. 173m² floor area on 187m² of land, PLUS approx. 13m² of deck -- total 186m2\r\n\r\n23B - $1,880,000\r\nApprox. 192m² floor area | 144m² site | PLUS approx. 45m² of additional deck, balcony & storage space-- total 237m2\r\n\r\n23C - $1,880,000\r\nApprox. 192m² floor area | 144m² site | PLUS approx. 42m² of additional deck, balcony & storage space -- total 234m2\r\n\r\n23D - $1,980,000\r\nApprox. 192m² floor area | 213m² site | PLUS approx. 61m² of additional deck, balcony & storage space-- total 253m2\r\n\r\nDiscover refined coastal living in the highly sought-after Campbells Bay, where luxury, comfort and easy-care living come together.\r\n\r\nBuilt by a reputable local developer, these brand-new homes showcase quality craftsmanship, premium materials and thoughtful modern design. Natural timber and stone finishes, floor-to-ceiling windows and abundant natural light create a warm and sophisticated atmosphere.\r\n\r\nOffering four spacious bedrooms, three bathrooms including two ensuites, and a guest powder room, the layout is ideal for families, guests or multi-generational living. The designer kitchen flows seamlessly into open-plan living and dining areas, with easy indoor-outdoor flow to private gardens and balconies.\r\n\r\nFull central air conditioning ensures year-round comfort — warm in winter and cool in summer. A standout feature is the private internal lift connecting all three levels( except 23A), providing effortless access throughout the home and making it an excellent long-term option for those looking to downsize or plan for the future.\r\n\r\nSmart-home features including lighting, CCTV, video doorbell and remote garage control add convenience and security, complemented by a double internal-access garage. Families will appreciate zoning for Rangitoto College, Westlake Boys’ High School and Westlake Girls’ High School, together with Campbells Bay Primary School and Murrays Bay Intermediate. This combination of highly sought-after school zones and a premium coastal location adds strong long-term appeal.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a short stroll to Campbells Bay Beach, local cafés, parks and transport. This welcoming seaside community offers a relaxed coastal lifestyle while remaining close to everything the North Shore has to offer.\r\nWhether you're raising a family, downsizing, or simply seeking a luxurious home without the burden of extensive maintenance, this is effortless living designed for now and the future.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.",
